repository-code: 'https://github.com/Heckford/bc-connectivity'
abstract: >-
  Code to produce a connectivity map for the intactness of old
  forests to inform biodiversity management for the Quesnel
  Natural Resource District, British Columbia. Part of Phase 3
  of an Ecological Corridors project developing analytical
  tools for practitioners to implement Connectivity, Corridors,
  and Functional Ecological Networks (C-C-FEN). Uses a targets
  workflow in R for spatial data preparation, and Omniscape.jl
  for circuit theory-based connectivity modelling.
keywords:
  - landscape connectivity
  - ecological corridors
  - circuit theory
  - Omniscape
  - old growth forest
  - biodiversity
  - British Columbia
  - targets
license: Apache-2.0
